st 55 forecast for days 4–6. On day 7 the warehouse holds about 119 of 148, so there is spare room.\n- Candidate 2 orders slightly more and still mostly stays within capacity.\n- Candidate 7 orders about 1.3× forecast. On day 7 stock reaches about 153, above the 148 limit, so arrivals overflow even at forecast demand. When demand comes in low the overflow gets worse.\n- Candidate 6 orders less than candidate 0, so it pays more in shortage penalties.\n\n**Candidate 3 (every 4 days).** It saves about 78 in fixed costs. But on day 8 stock reaches about 160, so it overflows even at forecast demand. Its product 1 orders cover 4 days, so more stock is close to expiry. Both effects work against it when demand varies.\n\n**Ranking by expected result:** 2 ≈ 0, then 7 and 6, then 1, 3 and 5, and 4 last."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4380, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4380}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:34:45.258Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVMQjghMr7QJFqi192b7"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01W7emBq1b4KGvZy9JWU1gta", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVMQjubSn72UZ1eZZWjG", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01W7emBq1b4KGvZy9JWU1gta", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.25, 